@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title HydroSentinel: Activity Diagram, report to verified repair

|Citizen|
start
:Choose province, WSA, issue type;
:Describe problem, pin location, add photos;
:Submit report;
|System|
if (Valid input and WSA exists?) then (no)
  :Return 422 or 404;
  |Citizen|
  :See error message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|System|
:Save report, keep image files only,\ncreate reference code;
|AI (GPT-4o)|
:Write acknowledgement for the citizen;
|Citizen|
:See reference code and AI reply;
|Admin|
:Sign in, open the report, set "in review";
:Press Draft with AI for the ticket;
|AI (GPT-4o)|
:Draft instructions, suggest a contractor\n(template text if OpenAI fails);
|Admin|
:Edit the draft and press Assign;
|System|
if (Report already has an open ticket?) then (yes)
  :Return 409;
  |Admin|
  :Reload and check the ticket;
  stop
else (no)
endif
|System|
:Save ticket, notify the contractor,\nwrite audit row;
|Contractor|
if (Accept the job?) then (no)
  :Reject with a reason;
  |System|
  :Free the report for another contractor;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Contractor|
:Start work, add repair photos;
:Mark fixed with a note;
|System|
:Ticket becomes "fixed",\nreport stays "in review";
|Admin|
if (Work is correct?) then (no)
  :Send back with a note;
  |Contractor|
  :Fix again;
else (yes)
endif
|Admin|
:Verify the repair;
|System|
:Close ticket, resolve report, write audit row;
|Citizen|
:Track report, see "resolved";
stop
@enduml
